'''Phanpy''' (Japanese: '''ゴマゾウ''' ''Gomazou'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

