==Trivia==
The {{TCGP|Promo-A}} print of this card was included in internal game files prior to the release of the card on August 28, 2025; with the same illustration as on the {{TCG ID|Triumphant Light|Phanpy|37}} card from the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion, originally featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Phanpy|111}} from the TCG's {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion. When the card became available to players with the Quagsire [[Wonder Pick Event (Quagsire)|Wonder Pick Event]], it was updated with new artwork.

