===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Phanpy|100}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion; both cards have the Flail attack.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Phanpy|117}}, one of the {{TCG|SWSH Black Star Promos}}.
*{{m|Flail}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Phanpy}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

